  "description": "This elegant green peppercorn pan sauce requires just a handful of ingredients and is easy to prepare. Spoon it over seared steak, chicken, pork, or even fish for a restaurant-worthy dinner.",
  "notes": "Optional substitutions: homemade beef stock → homemade chicken stock or store-bought low-sodium chicken broth\n\nMake-ahead and storage: This sauce is best enjoyed right away, but it can be refrigerated in an airtight container for up to 2 days. Gently reheat in a saucepan over low heat on the stove top, whisking constantly before serving.",
